@startuml Create Outbound Order

title 申請出庫（POST /api/v1/outbound，WarehouseUserOnly）—— 建立時就是 Processing，觸發 Inventory 預留

actor "一般員工\n(WarehouseUser)" as User

box "Ordering.Api" #LightBlue
    participant "CreateOutboundEndpoint" as Endpoint
end box

box "Ordering.Application" #LightYellow
    participant "ISender" as Sender
    participant "TransactionalDecorator" as Decorator
    participant "CreateOutboundCommandHandler" as Handler
    participant "OutboundOrderCreated\nDomainEventHandler" as DomainHandler
end box

box "Ordering.Domain" #Lavender
    participant "OutboundOrder" as Order
end box

box "Ordering.Infrastructure" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IProductRepository" as ProductRepo
    participant "IOutboundOrderRepository" as OrderRepo
    participant "IOrderingUnitOfWork" as UoW
    participant "IIntegrationEventWriter" as Writer
end box

database "ordering_db" as DB
queue "Kafka\ntopic: ordering.events" as Kafka

User -> Endpoint : POST /api/v1/outbound { orderNo, items[] }
Endpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(CreateOutboundCommand)
Sender -> Decorator : HandleAsync(request, next, ct)
Decorator -> UoW : BeginAsync(ct)
Decorator -> Handler : next()

Handler -> ProductRepo : GetExistingIdsAsync(requestedProductIds, ct)
alt 有商品編號不存在
    Handler --> Decorator : Error 404 NotFound
else 全部存在
    Handler -> Order : OutboundOrder.Create(orderNo, warehouseId, requestedBy, items)
    Order -> Order : Status = Processing\n（不是 Pending！管理員這時還看不到、審核不到）
    Order -> Order : RaiseDomainEvent(OutboundOrderCreatedDomainEvent)
    Order --> Handler : Result.Success(order)
    Handler -> OrderRepo : AddAsync(order, ct)
    OrderRepo -> DB : insert into outbound_orders, outbound_order_items
    Handler --> Decorator : Result.Success(CreateOutboundDto { Status: "Processing" })
end

Decorator -> UoW : CommitAsync(ct)
UoW -> DomainHandler : PublishAsync(OutboundOrderCreatedDomainEvent) → HandleAsync
DomainHandler -> Writer : WriteAsync(OutboundOrderCreatedIntegrationEvent, ct)
Writer -> DB : insert into outbox_messages（同一個 transaction）
UoW -> DB : commit
Decorator --> Sender : result
Sender --> Endpoint : result
Endpoint --> User : 201 Created { id, status: "Processing" }

... 之後由 OutboxProcessor 背景輪詢送出 ...
DB -> Kafka : OutboundOrderCreatedIntegrationEvent

note over Kafka
  接下來是跨 bounded context 的部分，
  見 docs/inventory/usecase/reserve-stock-on-outbound-created.puml
  （Inventory 消費、TryReserve、回覆 Reserved/Failed）
  跟本資料夾的 consume-inventory-reply.puml
  （Ordering 消費 Inventory 的回覆，轉成 Pending/Rejected）。
end note

@enduml
